{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:69b97692dcce4d28","name":"Shockboxer Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-69b97692dcce4d28","title":"Shockboxer Talent Tree","revision":20945,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:51:21Z","sha256":"a46fbdc7b5c06bc35c43350bb9a6bdd30f287262785d7b166bbd1d04ee5edd2e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20945","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shockboxer%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-69b97692dcce4d28","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shockboxing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shockboxing","referenceId":"reference:9e155f6537d75d18"}," fighting style and can use your fists to devastate your enemies. Although you trained for competitive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shockboxing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shockboxing","referenceId":"reference:9e155f6537d75d18"},", much of your expertise can also be applied outside the ring.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defensive Jab"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Retaliation Jab"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," and take the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fight Defensively"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fight_Defensively","referenceId":"reference:ce11520546392760"}," Action, you can make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," against an adjacent target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Nimble Dodge"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If an enemy misses you with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"},", as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," you can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to 2 squares, but you must end your movement adjacent to your attacker.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Retaliation Jab"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If an enemy misses you with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"},", as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," you can automatically deal damage equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier (minimum 1 point of damage) to your attacker, if the attacker is within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stinging Jab"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you hit a target with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"},", you can choose to deal half damage with your attack. If you do so, your enemy also deals half damage on all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:dbacc8ccae71d4dc"}," he or she makes until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stunning Shockboxer"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Stinging Jab"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you deal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage to a target with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"},", after the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," is halved, roll one extra die of damage and add that to the damage subtracted from the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
